==Battleground==
*Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 80~136.67 seconds<sup>2,400f~4,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 41.33 seconds<sup>1,240f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~23.33 seconds<sup>60f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 2~23.33 seconds<sup>60f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 4~20 seconds<sup>120f~600f</sup>.
*20 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hermit Peng]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 10~36.67 seconds<sup>300f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Master Da Xun]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This is a EoC 3/Early SoL stage, stack [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]] to safely damage enemies. If you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], you can beat the level easily.

